Z||000000||pherder||12-26-2001||07:19 PM||||Doing my normal scan of the eBay Fiero stuff and found this ... 1988 Fiero GT.<BR> <A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=1682357953" TARGET=_blank>http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=1682357953</A> <P>Only it is an 1987 ... can you find how I arrived at that date?      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I will post later the two things I see that make it NOT an 1988 GT, one that dates it to 1987.<P>BTW, I just got a bounced message from the email I sent the seller.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 12-26-2001).]||||reg||1
