Z||000002||pherder||12-26-2001||07:34 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mrfiero:<BR><B> <BR>Too easy Paul!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>It has silver lower rockers, gray lace wheels (15x7 on all four corners) and the seats are not from an '88 GT.<P>How's that?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Better than I!!!  I missed the seats!<P>At first I thought that it had a sticker "Fiero" on the intake but supersizing that picture showed me it was an 1987 with the cast in "Fiero".<P>Paul<BR>||||reg||1
